  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e1d8adf9-adfd-5832-bb9c-f7bfb03731d9" activityNameId="920a3488-6ed0-5d74-9030-0a11d07f7698" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Flat plate collector, copper absorber, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Flat plate collector, copper absorber, at plant
One collector has an aparture area of 2.72 m2 and an empty weight of 52 kg. The dataset refers to 1 m2 aparture area. The flat plate collector has a selective black chrome coating on copper produced in the US. ;
UUID: 646cf85a-0ca1-30dd-b77d-9da3b98578b5
Production and disposal of a flat plate collector with a copper absorber in Switzerland. Including materials, water and energy use of production. Materials for mounting on roof are excluded.
Location: Production in CH. Main components are imported from the US. The glass is coated in DK.
Technology: Assembly of a flat plate collector. The collector has a copper sheet coated by black chrome coating.
Time period: Material data have been investigated for a collector produced in 2002. Data for energy uses during production have been investigated for 2001.
Production volume: In 2009 135'355 m2 of flat plate collectors (95 MW capacity) were sold in CH.
Sampling: Questionnaires. 
Extrapolations: Energy use during production investigated in an other factory.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_646cf85a-0ca1-30dd-b77d-9da3b98578b5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
